- PLAY2PROMPT (EBaMTeWi2K): Most directly comparable work on iterative tool documentation refinement. Scores: 3, 5, 5, 3, 5. Withdrawn/Rejected.
- ToolEVO (wtrDLMFU9v): LLM adaptation to evolving tools via MCTS. Scores: 6, 3, 6, 1. Accept (Poster).
- MAC-CAFE (Ql7msQBqoF): Iterative KB refinement via LLM feedback. Scores: 1, 3, 3, 6. Reject.
- ToolLLM (dHng2O0Jjr): Large-scale tool-use benchmark and training framework. Scores: 6, 8, 6, 8. Accept (Spotlight).
- RePrompt (bgcdO9lmug): Prompt optimization via reflection for LLM agents. Scores: 3, 5, 3, 5. Reject.

