6. **Unclear scalability with number of context views**: The paper shows results for only 1-view and 2-view contexts on ShapeNet, and 1-view/3-view on DTU. It is unclear how the method performs with more context views (e.g., 3, 6, or 9 views, which is standard in many generalizable NeRF evaluations). The review of MRVM-NeRF (SEiuSzlD1d) raised a similar point: "it might be interesting to investigate the few-shot results in more detail... showing that the pretraining objective now enables tasks that were previously not looked at."

